<title>UK: Credit Suisse sets 500 mln SFR 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse sets 500 mln SFR 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CS HOLDING</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    23.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.625   PAY DATE    23.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   07.MAY.97</p>
</text>
